{"at":"2026-02-27T23:31:17.386Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":691,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/realease-notes-and-roadmap/new-features-roadmap/","title":"New Features & Roadmap","description":null,"body":"<div class=\"shortcode_title\" style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);\"><h1 style=\"letter-spacing: -0.03em;\">New Features &amp; Roadmap</h1><div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div></div><div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\" style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);\"><div class=\"doc-content-wrap\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"12378\" class=\"elementor elementor-12378\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de29a61 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"de29a61\" data-element_type=\"container\"><div class=\"e-con-inner\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c36379b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c36379b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\">We are dedicated to providing our members with the latest technology and innovative tools to make searching, sharing, and selling simpler and more efficient.</p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong>If you have suggestions, please explore the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/request-new-features/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">Request New Features page</a>&nbsp;to upvote ideas or add your own if it’s not already listed.</strong></p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\">Below, you’ll find a Roadmap of our latest and upcoming features and updates:</p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong><u><br></u></strong></p><h2 style=\"letter-spacing: -0.02em;\"><strong><u>Milestones met:</u></strong></h2><div><strong><u><br></u></strong></div><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">28th January 2025&nbsp;</span>✅<em><br></em></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MLS Soft Launch Date to Pioneers</span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">12th February 2025&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><strong>✅</strong></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><strong><br></strong></span></em>MLS Launch Date to WhatsApp Groups with 2,500+ estate agents &amp; Public Release.</p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">1st April 2025</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">✅</span><br></strong>New Feature:&nbsp; Short-Term Rentals Launch</p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">20th January 2026</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">✅</span></strong><em><br></em>New Feature:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/ai-ezd_ampersand-automation/ai-property-research-agent/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 800;\">AI Property Report Agent</a></p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">16th February 2026</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">✅</span></strong><em style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></em><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">New Feature:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/marketing-and-promotion/feature-your-property-on-the-public-property-portal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154); font-weight: 800; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Public Portal</a><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Launch</span></p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><h2 style=\"letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><u>Milestones to come:</u></strong></h2><div><strong><u><br></u></strong></div><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">1st March 2026</span></strong><em><br></em>New Feature:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/new-developments/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154); font-weight: 800;\">New Developments</a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">8th April 2025</span></strong><em style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></em><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">New Feature:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/requests/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154); font-weight: 800; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">ReQuests</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>","seo_title":"New Features & Roadmap • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}